+        tpidr_el0, tpidrro_el0: the thread pointers this guest thread sees (on Horizon tpidrro_el0 points at the thread-local region).
+        vregs: {'v0': 128-bit int, ...} the vector registers going in (the others are 0), fpcr, fpsr; the result has 'v0'..'v31' (128-bit ints), 'fpcr' and 'fpsr' too"""
